# Runtime scratch from screenshots.py: the seeded auth database and the
# ingested weather store the local API writes while the captures are taken.
# Rebuilt on every run and specific to whoever ran it.
.tmp-*.db
# KaTeX is copied in from npm at build time by build.py; ~1 MB of fonts that
# does not belong in git when one command regenerates it.
katex/
__pycache__/
